Glance bundles third-party data / libraries:

1. ECDICT — Free English to Chinese Dictionary Database
   https://github.com/skywind3000/ECDICT
   License: MIT
   The file `glance-dict.db` is a filtered subset (common words only) of the
   ECDICT "stardict" CSV, converted to SQLite by `make_dict.py`.

Runtime Python dependencies keep their own licenses (see requirements.txt):
mss (MIT), pynput (LGPL-3.0), winsdk (MIT), pystray (LGPL-3.0 / GPL-2.0),
Pillow (MIT-CMU).
